From f162c4c9ca3a5bf7ec3cbfc51ad0a09829143d6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus Developer <dev@lotus.org>
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] avalanche: add Sui Mysticeti 1-RTT optimistic fast-path and
 AIMD epoch controller

Add a single-RTT optimistic fast-path when initial poll votes reach >=90%
supermajority confidence, and replace fixed epoch cadence with a
self-clocking AIMD epoch controller bounded between 50ms and 1000ms.
